<title>FINLAND: NOKIA OPENS DOWN AT $60-1/4 ON WALL STREET.</title>
<headline>NOKIA OPENS DOWN AT $60-1/4 ON WALL STREET.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened $0-1/4 lower at $60-1/4 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>The price corresponded to about 304.07 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
